[{:db/id "0634ee5a-1fe4-5615-bb1f-de6045b61f9d" :answer/id #uuid "0634ee5a-1fe4-5615-bb1f-de6045b61f9d" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "25008e01-79c7-58b7-aeed-e63a6324cfd6" :answer/id #uuid "25008e01-79c7-58b7-aeed-e63a6324cfd6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fd12a97e-9c51-5ed4-8b7d-226953a0be67" :answer-field/id #uuid "fd12a97e-9c51-5ed4-8b7d-226953a0be67" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["0634ee5a-1fe4-5615-bb1f-de6045b61f9d" "25008e01-79c7-58b7-aeed-e63a6324cfd6"] :answer-field/correct "25008e01-79c7-58b7-aeed-e63a6324cfd6" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "48843694-108e-5d14-bd01-367c88bbda7b" :answer/id #uuid "48843694-108e-5d14-bd01-367c88bbda7b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "66105f24-eeac-5dfa-906a-b29c7b525374" :answer/id #uuid "66105f24-eeac-5dfa-906a-b29c7b525374" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "caa6403a-374c-56a6-9e6e-eff87afdb677" :answer-field/id #uuid "caa6403a-374c-56a6-9e6e-eff87afdb677" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["48843694-108e-5d14-bd01-367c88bbda7b" "66105f24-eeac-5dfa-906a-b29c7b525374"] :answer-field/correct "48843694-108e-5d14-bd01-367c88bbda7b" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "ac318550-2f86-5de9-9b06-3ca0446a83ae" :answer/id #uuid "ac318550-2f86-5de9-9b06-3ca0446a83ae" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "13e93d6b-04f6-5d4f-b5b6-d410c07da27b" :answer/id #uuid "13e93d6b-04f6-5d4f-b5b6-d410c07da27b" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "c469465a-d12b-5568-8d4c-567bbab54c8b" :answer-field/id #uuid "c469465a-d12b-5568-8d4c-567bbab54c8b" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["ac318550-2f86-5de9-9b06-3ca0446a83ae" "13e93d6b-04f6-5d4f-b5b6-d410c07da27b"] :answer-field/correct "13e93d6b-04f6-5d4f-b5b6-d410c07da27b" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "f4817fa1-7160-5d08-adc7-564c3155c399" :question/id #uuid "f4817fa1-7160-5d08-adc7-564c3155c399" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $N$ given below?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $N$ is a singular matrix\n- **II.** $N$ is **not** a singular matrix\n- **III.** $det(N)=0$\n\n$$\nN=\\begin{bmatrix}\\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3} & 1 & 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3} & - \\frac{1}{3} & \\sqrt{2} \\\\ - \\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{3} & -2 & - 4 \\sqrt{2}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(N) & =|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3} & 1 & 2 \\sqrt{2} \\\\ - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3} & - \\frac{1}{3} & \\sqrt{2} \\\\ - \\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{3} & -2 & - 4 \\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3}|\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{1}{3} & \\sqrt{2} \\\\ -2 & - 4 \\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}|+(-1)|\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3} & \\sqrt{2} \\\\ - \\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{3} & - 4 \\sqrt{2}\\end{aligned}|+2 \\sqrt{2}|\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{3} & - \\frac{1}{3} \\\\ - \\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{3} & -2\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =\\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3}(\\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{3}+2 \\sqrt{2})+(-1)(\\frac{8}{3}+\\frac{8}{3})+2 \\sqrt{2}(\\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3}- \\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{9}) \\\\  & =\\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{3}\\cdot \\frac{10 \\sqrt{2}}{3}+(-1)\\cdot \\frac{16}{3}+2 \\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{9} \\\\  & =\\frac{40}{9}- \\frac{16}{3}+\\frac{8}{9} \\\\  & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(N)=0$, the matrix is singular. \n\nTherefore, only statements I and III are true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["fd12a97e-9c51-5ed4-8b7d-226953a0be67" "caa6403a-374c-56a6-9e6e-eff87afdb677" "c469465a-d12b-5568-8d4c-567bbab54c8b"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "db4c2f01-affa-593d-9e86-c0393439ae7e" :answer/id #uuid "db4c2f01-affa-593d-9e86-c0393439ae7e" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "670467a6-e81c-5c99-be97-28f089cc9d37" :answer/id #uuid "670467a6-e81c-5c99-be97-28f089cc9d37" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fbad6dc2-1046-5c88-93da-58012356da43" :answer-field/id #uuid "fbad6dc2-1046-5c88-93da-58012356da43" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["db4c2f01-affa-593d-9e86-c0393439ae7e" "670467a6-e81c-5c99-be97-28f089cc9d37"] :answer-field/correct "db4c2f01-affa-593d-9e86-c0393439ae7e" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "4f10ee21-6b89-5e0f-a04a-e49bcfa4c907" :answer/id #uuid "4f10ee21-6b89-5e0f-a04a-e49bcfa4c907" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "fe16b8a0-13d3-5554-8edd-ff60470da1a2" :answer/id #uuid "fe16b8a0-13d3-5554-8edd-ff60470da1a2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "283cd5ed-404d-513a-8b29-74966f63a5de" :answer-field/id #uuid "283cd5ed-404d-513a-8b29-74966f63a5de" :answer-field/key "II" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["4f10ee21-6b89-5e0f-a04a-e49bcfa4c907" "fe16b8a0-13d3-5554-8edd-ff60470da1a2"] :answer-field/correct "fe16b8a0-13d3-5554-8edd-ff60470da1a2" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "9bbf7977-41f6-5bb2-bc84-9b91b4aa2e00" :answer/id #uuid "9bbf7977-41f6-5bb2-bc84-9b91b4aa2e00" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "b655c0ce-1985-5548-8848-5fb9f83b43c3" :answer/id #uuid "b655c0ce-1985-5548-8848-5fb9f83b43c3" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "57424796-2385-5961-a89c-2d74ee068fcd" :answer-field/id #uuid "57424796-2385-5961-a89c-2d74ee068fcd" :answer-field/key "III" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["9bbf7977-41f6-5bb2-bc84-9b91b4aa2e00" "b655c0ce-1985-5548-8848-5fb9f83b43c3"] :answer-field/correct "9bbf7977-41f6-5bb2-bc84-9b91b4aa2e00" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "58253580-dd5c-51ba-b42f-aea83256773d" :question/id #uuid "58253580-dd5c-51ba-b42f-aea83256773d" :question/problem "Which of the following statements are true regarding the matrix $D$ given below?\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** $D$ is a singular matrix\n- **II.** $D$ is **not** a singular matrix\n- **III.** $det(D)=0$\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5} & \\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\ \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5} & - \\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5} & \\frac{4}{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\end{bmatrix}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Remember that a square matrix is singular if its determinant is equal to $0.$\n\nUsing the formula, we take the alternating sum of the entries in the top row of the matrix, multiplied by their respective minors, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}det(D) & =|\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5} & \\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\ \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5} & - \\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5} & \\frac{4}{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5})|\\begin{aligned}- \\frac{2}{5} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\ \\frac{4}{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\end{aligned}|+(- \\frac{2}{5})|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5} & \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\end{aligned}|+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5} & - \\frac{2}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5} & \\frac{4}{5}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5})(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{10}- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{5})+(- \\frac{2}{5})(- \\frac{3}{10}+\\frac{3}{10})+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}(\\frac{12 \\sqrt{2}}{25}- \\frac{6 \\sqrt{2}}{25}) \\\\  & =(- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5})\\cdot (- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{10})+(- \\frac{2}{5})\\cdot 0+\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{4}\\cdot \\frac{6 \\sqrt{2}}{25} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{25}+\\frac{3}{25} \\\\  & =\\frac{6}{25}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(D)=\\frac{6}{25}\\ne 0$, the matrix is **not** singular. \n\nTherefore, only statement II is true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["fbad6dc2-1046-5c88-93da-58012356da43" "283cd5ed-404d-513a-8b29-74966f63a5de" "57424796-2385-5961-a89c-2d74ee068fcd"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "623acce1-fff7-50e6-838b-7b0788c7f4cc" :answer/id #uuid "623acce1-fff7-50e6-838b-7b0788c7f4cc" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6f989a4f-56c1-50c2-8a6c-3fc3965f7ada" :answer/id #uuid "6f989a4f-56c1-50c2-8a6c-3fc3965f7ada" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "25dfb153-bf6c-5bc8-81b3-3f8c8e55fd75" :answer-field/id #uuid "25dfb153-bf6c-5bc8-81b3-3f8c8e55fd75" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["623acce1-fff7-50e6-838b-7b0788c7f4cc" "6f989a4f-56c1-50c2-8a6c-3fc3965f7ada"] :answer-field/correct "623acce1-fff7-50e6-838b-7b0788c7f4cc" :db/ensure :answer-field/validate} {:db/id "7a8e8b31-aab5-5ebf-9a6d-c0ce4e4dec83" :answer/id #uuid "7a8e8b31-aab5-5ebf-9a6d-c0ce4e4dec83" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "6ea2a503-d065-55b2-8fd1-d25f4f09f9f5" :answer/id #uuid "6ea2a503-d065-55b2-8fd1-d25f4f09f9f5" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "7227b94e-e860-5cf3-bd06-90e04b0b9867" :answer-field/id #uuid "7227b94e-e860-5cf3-bd