 & \\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{2}{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{4}{5} & \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ \\frac{2}{5} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}|+(- \\frac{2}{5})|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{2} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4} & - \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}\\end{aligned}|+(- \\sqrt{2})|\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2} & \\frac{4}{5} \\\\ - \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{4} & \\frac{2}{5}\\end{aligned}| \\\\  & =(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})(- \\frac{2 \\sqrt{2}}{5}- \\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5})+(- \\frac{2}{5})(- \\frac{1}{2}+\\frac{9}{4})+(- \\sqrt{2})(\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{5}+\\frac{3 \\sqrt{2}}{5}) \\\\  & =(- \\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2})\\cdot (- \\sqrt{2})+(- \\frac{2}{5})\\cdot \\frac{7}{4}+(- \\sqrt{2})\\cdot \\frac{4 \\sqrt{2}}{5} \\\\  & =1- \\frac{7}{10}- \\frac{8}{5} \\\\  & =- \\frac{13}{10}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSince $det(R)=- \\frac{13}{10}\\ne 0$, the matrix is **not** singular. \n\nTherefore, only statement II is true." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["25dfb153-bf6c-5bc8-81b3-3f8c8e55fd75" "7227b94e-e860-5cf3-bd06-90e04b0b9867" "e852e547-0a05-5456-8b75-a7942f7d0613"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "fb3191b2-823c-5ff2-9063-c65501bb4dc4" :answer/id #uuid "fb3191b2-823c-5ff2-9063-c65501bb4dc4" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "false" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "87861eb3-5f89-51bb-a83b-a2a2f34426b6" :answer/id #uuid "87861eb3-5f89-51bb-a83b-a2a2f34426b6" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "true" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "0187374c-e9df-5d8a-b2e7-160b085f7e8a" :answer-field/id #uuid "0187374c-e9df-5d8a-b2e7-160b085f7e8a" :answer-field/key "I" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/checkbox :answer-field/choices ["fb3191b2-823c-5ff2-9063-c65501bb4dc4" "87861eb3-5f89-51bb-a83b-a2a2f34426b6"] :answer-field/correct "fb3191b2-823c-5ff2-9063-c65501bb4dc4"